{"_type":"shard","campaign_names":["Empire City","Roanoke S4","Roanoke Season 4 / Empire City","Season 4, Empire City","roanoke-s4"],"channel":{"category":"Ferrytown","id":"852766832552837160","name":"gamebooth-ring-toss⏩⭕","position":94,"server_id":"850779382791536640","topic":"Dexterity-based game booth on Illo'fae. Rules: Ring toss, throw a ring (Dex check) onto a bottle, 3 tosses, 3 times a day Limit one of each prize per player.","type":"0"},"database_path":"discord/empire-city/empire-city.sqlite","database_sha256":"a0c71f99ff403e5a91d88c2dfb647326cbc332b4b943fa207cb080173a83f98e","project_ids":["roanoke-s4"],"server":{"harvested_at":"2026-10-02T13:43:57Z","id":"850779382791536640","name":"Empire City."},"server_slug":"empire-city"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"852766832552837160","content":"You walk up and you see a booth that at first seems to be well stocked with furry prizes, but upon closer inspection the furry prizes are moving and appear to be… manning the booth? They scurry to and fro and when they see you, you hear a squeal of enjoyment, their little hands beckoning you closer. They motion to three bottles on a table at the back of the booth, and place three rings on the counter before you.","created_at":"2021-06-11T04:32:51.530000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"852767314931613736","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[{"content_type":"image/png","filename":"dexterity.png","id":"852767351786438686","local_path":"discord/empire-city/attachments/852766832552837160/852767351786438686-dexterity.png","message_id":"852767351980294194","sha256":"de60f89bcf6757868622acae776d6fd0fb4972ca92f778cc61aeff1ed40cd0fe","size":128461,"url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/852766832552837160/852767351786438686/dexterity.png?ex=6ac0857c&is=6abf33fc&hm=640510189eb4f97fc9831d86dc614809c6564704ec7230860f43d66ff2fbd2ef&"}],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"852766832552837160","content":"","created_at":"2021-06-11T04:33:00.363000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"852767351980294194","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"852766832552837160","content":"**Rules:** Throw rings onto bottles (make three Dexterity checks, no modifier)\n\n\n** 3 tosses, 3 times a day**\n\n**Limit one of each prize per player.**\n\n**If lost, (18 or lower for all three rings) **\nA cacophony of little voices let out sighs and sounds of consolation.\n\n**DC 19**\n**1 ring**- fingerless leather gloves that automatically change style to fit the latest fashion trends\nIf won, post: squeals and clapping abound, the small pom-pom like creatures hand you a pair of fingerless gloves.\n\n**2 rings**- Rope of mending A rope of mending looked like a regular rope made of hemp. It was sold in coils of 50 feet (15 meters). If the rope was cut into smaller lengths, it could be mended by uttering a special command word. The shortened lengths had to be in contact with one another and not in use for the mending to be successful.\nIf won, post: Shrill sounds escape the furry booth attendants, they seem excited for you. Together, they manage to get a rope down from the top of the booth and lay it on the counter. \n\n**3 rings**-Whisper Powder-Wondrous item (consumable) A shimmering fae powder that when sprinkled on a creature affects only them with the silence spell. While affected this way you have advantage on stealth checks to not be heard. The effect lasts for 10 minutes.\nIf won, post: Silence befalls the booth as soon as the third ring settles on the bottle. All of the furry creatures stop and stare at you. An explosion of celebration begins; some are high fiving each other, others are squealing in delight as they hang from the rafters, one looks you in the eye and slides you a small pouch at the end of a corded necklace. You don't know what it is for, but clearly you have earned it.","created_at":"2021-06-11T04:33:38.130000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-11T16:15:37.556000Z","id":"852767510385917962","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
